# The upstream names Zen's story is not told with. Read by scripts/check-zen.mjs,
# which runs at the end of the build and fails it on a hit.
#
# One name per line; `#` starts a comment. Case is ignored and a name matches as
# a whole word — no letter directly before or after it — so `Qwen` also catches
# Qwen3, Qwen3.8, qwen35, qwen4 and Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration.
#
# A Zen page says these names in two places only, and marks both `data-upstream`:
# the Architecture value (the loader string from the weights' own config) and the
# License & attribution section at the bottom. A post whose subject is another
# lab's release is marked at its article. Everything else a reader meets — title,
# description, headings, prose, tables, alt text — says Zen.
#
# The list starts from the base models the zenlm cards on Hugging Face declare.
# A new one goes here, and nowhere else.
Qwen
QwenLM
QwQ
QVQ
Flash-Next
Bonsai
prism-ml
DeepSeek
MiniMax
Wan
Granite
Nemotron
unsloth
FLUX
TRELLIS
YuE
SSD-1B
